From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:02:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] libs: Import the decoder of libwebp 1.6.0.

The decoding library, the demuxer and the animation decoder, with the
generic and SSE2 versions of their DSP code, from the release at
https://storage.googleapis.com/downloads.webmproject.org/releases/webp/
(sha256 e4ab7009bf0629fd11982d4c2aa83964cf244cffba7347ecd39019a9e38c4564).
Windows' WebP decoder is libwebp's: what it gives for lossy, lossless,
alpha and animated files is byte for byte what libwebp decodes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit c6061acedd8ff1dbfc485464e873fcb414c0f950)

